// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Timeframe Helper Functions {
var series int week_start_day = dayofweek.monday
var series int new_day_start_time = 0
f_tf(string _symbol, string _res, float _src, bool _repaint = false) =>
    request.security(_symbol, _res, _src[_repaint ? 0 : barstate.isrealtime ? 1 : 0])[_repaint ? 0 : barstate.isrealtime ? 0 : 1]
f_tf_isNewDay() => //hour == new_day_start_time and minute == 0 and second == 0 ? true : false
    timeframe.change('1D')
f_tf_isNewWeek() =>
    dayofweek == week_start_day ? true : false
f_tf_backtestWindow() =>
    bool _return = __BACKTEST_RANGE ? time >= __STARTF and time <= __FINISHT ? true : false : true
    _return
f_tf_equal(simple string _tf) =>
    _tf == timeframe.period or _tf == EMPTY
f_tf_interval(string _int, bool _trade) =>
    _int == PER_TRADE ? _trade : _int == PER_BAR ? true : _int == EVERY_5M ? minute % 5 == 0 and minute != minute[1] : _int == EVERY_15M ? minute % 15 == 0 and minute != minute[1] : _int == EVERY_30M ? minute % 30 == 0 and minute != minute[1] : false
    // }


//  ▪ ORDERBOOK ─────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Condition {
series bool __ORX_LONG = orx.isLongPos()
series bool __ORX_SHORT = orx.isShortPos()
series bool __ORX_EXEC = strategy.position_size != strategy.position_size[1]
series bool __ORX_OPEN = orx.isOpen()
series bool __ORX_CLOSE = not __ORX_OPEN
series bool __ORX_OPENED = orx.isOpen() and not orx.isOpen()[1]
series bool __ORX_CLOSED = not __ORX_OPEN and __ORX_OPEN[1]
// }

// ── Price {
f_order_openProfit(series float _avgPrice) =>
    float((__ORX_LONG ? close - _avgPrice : _avgPrice - close) * strategy.position_size)
f_order_avgPrice(simple string _engine, series float _sum, series float _contracts) =>
    float(_engine == CUSTOM ? math.abs(_sum / _contracts) : strategy.position_avg_price)
    // }


//  ▪ GRID FUNCTIONS ─────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ── Fixed Grid Wrapper
//
// REMINDER: >= <=
// ✅ FIXED: Changed _len from simple float to series float for dynamic spacing support
f_grid_fixed(series float _src, series float _len, series float _rescale) =>
    series float s = _rescale * _len
    var series float g = math.floor(nz(_src, math.floor(close / s) * s) / s) * s
    g := _src > g + s ? g + s : _src < g - s ? g - s : g
    g
    // }

// ── Chande Momentum Oscilator {
//
f_cmo(series float _src, series int _len) =>
    float mom = ta.change(_src)
    float upSum = math.sum(math.max(mom, 0), _len)
    float downSum = math.sum(-math.min(mom, 0), _len)
    (upSum - downSum) / (upSum + downSum)
    // }

// ── React MA {
//
f_ma_react(series float _src, series int _len, series float _dyn, series float _power, series int _cmoLen) =>
    var series float v = _src
    series float cmo = math.abs(f_cmo(_src, _cmoLen))
    series float alpha = 2 / (_len + 1)
    v := _src * alpha * cmo + nz(v[1], _src) * (1 - alpha * cmo)
    series float sumX = 0.
    series float sumY = 0.
    series float width = _power / 100 * _dyn
    for i = 0 to _len - 1 by 1
        series float w = (1 - math.pow(i / width, 2)) * math.exp(-(i * i / (2 * math.pow(width, 2))))
        sumY := sumY + w
        sumX := sumX + v[i] * w
        sumX
    sumX / sumY
    // }

// ── Variable Index Dynamic Average [Ehler, Chande] {
//
f_ma_vidya(series float _src, series int _len, series int _cmoLen) =>
    series float cmo = math.abs(f_cmo(_src, _cmoLen))
    series float alpha = 2 / (_len + 1)
    var series float vidya = _src
    vidya := _src * alpha * cmo + nz(vidya[1], _src) * (1 - alpha * cmo)
    float(vidya)
f_ma_vidya(series float _src, series int _len) =>
    _cmo = ta.cmo(_src, _len) / 100
    var _factor = 2 / (_len + 1)
    var series float _vidya = _src
    _vidya := _src * _factor * math.abs(_cmo) + nz(_vidya[1], _src) * (1 - _factor * math.abs(_cmo))
    _vidya := _vidya == 0. ? _src : _vidya
    float(_vidya)
    // } 

// ── Fibonacci Retracement ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ── Function Grid Position {
//
f_grid_getPos(series float _src, series float _anker, simple float _devFct, simple int _slices) =>
    series float min = _anker - _anker * _devFct
    series float max = _anker + _anker * _devFct
    series int slices = _slices * 2
    series float fullrange = max - min
    series float range_1 = fullrange / slices
    series float height = math.abs(_src - min)
    series int raw = math.ceil(height / range_1)
    raw <= _slices ? raw - (_slices + 1) : raw - _slices
    // }

// ── Function Grid Retracement {
//
f_grid_getFiboRetracement(series int _pos) =>
    series int currentPos = math.abs(_pos) <= array.size(SERIES_FIBO) - 1 ? math.abs(_pos) : array.size(SERIES_FIBO) - 1
    float(array.get(SERIES_FIBO, currentPos))
    // }

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ──── Helper Functions {
//
f_barssince(_cond, _count) =>
    bar_index - ta.valuewhen(_cond, bar_index, _count)
f_dist(_src1, _src2) =>
    series float _dist = math.max(_src1, _src2) - math.min(_src1, _src2)
    series float _perc = _dist / math.max(_src1, _src2) * 100
    [_dist, _perc]
f_amountToAvgDist(_long, _avgPrice, _distFct) =>
    series float distPrice = not _long ? close * (1 - _distFct) : _long ? close * (1 + _distFct) : 0.
    series float diffToClose = math.abs(close - distPrice)
    series float diffToAvg = math.abs(_avgPrice - distPrice)
    float(math.abs(strategy.position_size) * (diffToAvg / diffToClose))
f_param_high_volatility(simple int _len1, simple int _len2) =>
    ta.atr(_len1) > ta.atr(_len2)
    // }


//  ▪ GRID INITIALISATION ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Source {
//
series float __SRC = __SRC_INPUT == SR_VY ? f_ma_vidya(__SRC_EXT, __GRID_REACT_LEN, __GRID_REACT_CMO) : __SRC_INPUT == SR_REACT ? f_ma_react(__SRC_EXT, __GRID_REACT_LEN, __GRID_REACT_DYN, __GRID_REACT_PWR, __GRID_REACT_CMO) : __SRC_EXT
// --
__SRC := f_tf_equal(__TF) ? __SRC : f_tf(syminfo.tickerid, __TF, __SRC)
// --
series float __SRC_VIDYA = f_ma_vidya(close, __GRID_REACT_LEN, __GRID_REACT_CMO)
series float __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED = f_ma_vidya(__SRC_EXT, __VDY_LEN_LONG, __VDY_CMO_LONG)
__SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED := f_tf_equal(__TF_BASELINE) ? __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED : f_tf(syminfo.tickerid, __TF_BASELINE, __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED)
// --
series bool __ALERT = if __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == REACT
    series bool __REACT_ALERT = ta.cross(__SRC_EXT, __SRC)
    __REACT_ALERT == false ? __ORX_LONG and __SRC_EXT > __SRC ? true : __ORX_SHORT and __SRC_EXT < __SRC ? true : false : true
else if __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA or __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA_LONG
    ta.cross(__SRC, __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA ? __SRC_VIDYA : __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED)
    // }

// ──── Fibonacci Retracement {
//
series int __POS = f_grid_getPos(close, __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED, __VDY_DEV_FCT, __VDY_BANDS_AMOUNT)
series float __RETRACEMENT = f_grid_getFiboRetracement(math.abs(__POS))
series float __HTF_CLOSE = f_tf(syminfo.tickerid, __HTF_RES, close)
// }


//  ▪ GRID ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Calculation {
//
series float __GRID_RESCALE_VALUE = switch __GRID_RESCALE
    MINTICK => syminfo.mintick
    PERCENT => close / 100
    PERCENT_HTF => __HTF_CLOSE / 100
    ATR => ta.atr(100)
// ✅ INTEGRATED: Using dynamic spacing instead of static __GRID_SCALE
__GRID := f_grid_fixed(__SRC, dynamicSpacing, __GRID_RESCALE_VALUE)
series float __GRID_SIZE = dynamicSpacing * __GRID_RESCALE_VALUE
series float __GRID_SIZE_PCT = __GRID_SIZE / close * 100
// }

// ──── Condition {
//
series int __SINCE_LONG = f_barssince(__GRID_LONG, 0)
series int __SINCE_SHORT = f_barssince(__GRID_SHORT, 0)
series int __SINCE_TRL = f_barssince(__TRL_HIT, 0)
series int __SINCE_ZERO = f_barssince(strategy.position_size == 0, 0)
series int __SINCE_LAST = math.min(__SINCE_LONG, __SINCE_SHORT, __SINCE_TRL)
series int __SINCE_START = strategy.position_size != 0 ? __SINCE_ZERO : 0
// --
__SIGNAL := __GRID > __GRID[1] ? -1 : __GRID < __GRID[1] ? 1 : 0
__CONDITION := __GRID > __GRID[1] ? -1 : __GRID < __GRID[1] ? 1 : __CONDITION
__GRID_LONG := __SIGNAL == 1
__GRID_SHORT := __SIGNAL == -1
__GRID_FLAT := __SIGNAL == 0

// ✅ GRID LEVEL MANAGEMENT: Temporarily disabled to debug core functionality
// TODO: Re-enable once core dynamic grid is working
// if __GRID_LONG
//     f_addGridLevel(__GRID, "LONG")
// if __GRID_SHORT
//     f_addGridLevel(__GRID, "SHORT")

// if bar_index % 10 == 0  // Every 10 bars
//     f_pruneDistantLevels(close, dynamicSpacing * 20)
// }

// ──── Counter {
//
var series int __GRID_CTR_LONG = 1
var series int __GRID_CTR_SHORT = 1
var series int __GRID_CTR = 1
// --
__GRID_CTR_LONG := __GRID_LONG[1] ? __GRID_CTR_LONG + 1 : __GRID_SHORT[1] or strategy.position_size == 0 ? 1 : __GRID_CTR_LONG
__GRID_CTR_SHORT := __GRID_SHORT[1] ? __GRID_CTR_SHORT + 1 : __GRID_LONG[1] or strategy.position_size == 0 ? 1 : __GRID_CTR_SHORT
__GRID_CTR := __GRID_LONG[1] or __GRID_SHORT[1] ? __GRID_CTR + 1 : strategy.position_size == 0 ? 1 : __GRID_CTR
// }


//  ▪ TREND
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Long-Term Trend {
//
series bool __TREND_UP = __SRC > __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED
series bool __TREND_DOWN = __SRC <= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED
series float __TREND = __TREND_UP ? 1 : __TREND_DOWN ? -1 : 0
series float __TREND_DIFF = math.abs(__SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED - __SRC)
series bool __TREND_RISING = ta.rising(__SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED, 7)
series bool __TREND_FALLING = ta.falling(__SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED, 7)
series bool __TREND_FLAT = not __TREND_RISING and not __TREND_FALLING
// }


//  ▪ ORDER MANAGEMENT ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Asset Management {
//
series float __CAPITAL = __TR_CL_BASE == EQUITY ? strategy.equity : __TR_CL_BASE == INITIAL ? strategy.initial_capital : strategy.initial_capital + strategy.netprofit
series float __MAX_MARGIN = __CAPITAL * (__TR_LEV - 1)
series float __MAX_CAPITAL = __CAPITAL + __MAX_MARGIN
// --
series float __QTY_FULL_ABS = math.abs(strategy.position_size)
// --
series float __MARGIN_USED_PCT = 0.
var series float __MAX_ORX = Pyramiding
if __QTY_FULL_ABS * close > strategy.equity
    series float sumOverEquity = __QTY_FULL_ABS * close - strategy.equity
    __MARGIN_USED_PCT := sumOverEquity / __MAX_MARGIN * 100
    __MARGIN_USED_PCT
var series float __MAX_MARGIN_USED_PCT = 0
__MAX_MARGIN_USED_PCT := math.max(__MARGIN_USED_PCT, __MAX_MARGIN_USED_PCT)
// --
series float __MARKET_VALUE = __ORX_AVG_PRICE * syminfo.pointvalue * __QTY_FULL_ABS
series float __MARGIN_MAINTENANCE = __MARKET_VALUE * MaintenanceMarginPct / 100
series float __MARGIN_RATIO_PCT = __MARGIN_MAINTENANCE / (strategy.equity - __MARGIN_MAINTENANCE) * 100
// --
series float __MAX_CTX = __MAX_CAPITAL / close
series float __MAX_CTX_USED_PCT = math.abs(strategy.max_contracts_held_all) / __MAX_CTX * 100
series float __CTX_USED_PCT = __QTY_FULL_ABS / __MAX_CTX * 100
var series int __MAX_ORX_USED = 0
__MAX_ORX_USED := math.max(strategy.opentrades, __MAX_ORX_USED)
// --
__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT := f_order_openProfit(__ORX_AVG_PRICE)
// --
var series float __HIGHEST_OPENPROFIT = 0
__HIGHEST_OPENPROFIT := math.max(nz(__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT, 0), __HIGHEST_OPENPROFIT)
var series float __HIGHEST_OPENLOSS = 0
__HIGHEST_OPENLOSS := math.min(nz(__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT, 0), __HIGHEST_OPENLOSS)
// -- Singleton Tulip Contracts Start Instance
series float __CTX_START = switch __TR_RISK_MGM
    CUSTOM => __CAPITAL / close * (__TR_RISK / 100) * __TR_LEV
    CLASSIC => __CAPITAL * (__TR_RISK / 100) * (100 / __TR_SL_PCT) / close
    // --

// ✅ INTEGRATED: Intelligent position sizing with risk management
series float distanceFromEntry = strategy.position_size != 0 ? math.abs(close - __ORX_AVG_PRICE) : 0
series float adjustedCtxLong = f_calculateEdgelessPositionSize(distanceFromEntry, __CTX_START, marketRisk)
series float adjustedCtxShort = f_calculateEdgelessPositionSize(distanceFromEntry, __CTX_START, marketRisk)

// Apply risk exposure limits
series float __CTX_LONG = adjustedCtxLong * riskAdjustedExposure
series float __CTX_SHORT = adjustedCtxShort * riskAdjustedExposure
// }

// ──── Equity Stop-Loss/Liquidation Warning { 
//
series float __WALLET = __TR_CL_BASE == EQUITY ? strategy.equity : __TR_CL_BASE == INITIAL ? strategy.initial_capital : strategy.initial_capital + strategy.netprofit
series float __WALLET_SP = __WALLET - __MARGIN_MAINTENANCE
series float __SL_SUM = __WALLET_SP * (__TR_SL_PCT / 100)
//--
series float __LQ_PRICE = __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE - __WALLET_SP / strategy.position_size : __ORX_SHORT ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE + __WALLET_SP / __QTY_FULL_ABS : 0.
[__LQ_DIFF, __LQ_DIFF_PCT] = f_dist(close, __LQ_PRICE)
//--
series float __SL_PRICE = __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE - __SL_SUM / strategy.position_size : __ORX_SHORT ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE + __SL_SUM / __QTY_FULL_ABS : 0.
//--
__LQ_PRICE := __LQ_PRICE < 0 ? float(na) : __LQ_PRICE
__SL_PRICE := __SL_PRICE < 0 ? float(na) : __SL_PRICE
//--
series float __SL_USED_PCT = __ORX_OPEN_PROFIT < 0 ? math.round(math.abs(__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT) / __SL_SUM * 100, 2) : 0.
var series float __MAX_SL_USED_PCT = 0.
__MAX_SL_USED_PCT := math.max(__SL_USED_PCT, __MAX_SL_USED_PCT)
series int __SL_WARN_LVL = math.ceil(__SL_USED_PCT / 20)
series int __MARGIN_WARN_LVL = math.ceil(__MARGIN_USED_PCT / 10)
// }


//  ▪ ATS TRAILING ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

//| @before [STATIC/TRAILING TAKE PROFIT]

// ──── Adaptive Trailing Stop {
//
calculateATS(series float _src, series int _len, simple float _factor, series bool _adaptive, series bool _smooth) =>
    // --
    series float atsX = 0.
    series float atsY = 0.
    series float atsOs = 0.
    series float atsUp = 0.
    series float atsDown = 0.
    // --
    series float atsCalc = _adaptive ? math.pow(math.abs(ta.change(_src, _len)) / math.sum(math.abs(ta.change(_src)), _len), _factor) : 1 / _len
    atsX := math.max(_src, nz(atsX[1], _src)) - math.abs(_src - nz(atsX[1], _src)) * atsCalc
    atsY := math.min(_src, nz(atsY[1], _src)) + math.abs(_src - nz(atsY[1], _src)) * atsCalc
    atsUp := atsX > atsX[1] ? atsX : atsX < atsX[1] and atsY < atsY[1] ? atsX : atsUp
    atsDown := atsY < atsY[1] ? atsY : atsY > atsY[1] and atsX > atsX[1] ? atsY : atsDown
    // --
    series bool crossX = ta.cross(_smooth ? atsX : atsUp, _src)
    series bool crossY = ta.cross(_smooth ? atsY : atsDown, _src)
    atsOs := crossX ? 1 : crossY ? 0. : atsOs[1]
    series float atsTs = atsOs * (_smooth ? atsY : atsDown) + (1 - atsOs) * (_smooth ? atsX : atsUp)
    series bool alertLong = ta.crossover(_src, atsTs)
    series bool alertShort = ta.crossunder(_src, atsTs)
    series bool alert = alertLong or alertShort
    // >>
    [alert, alertLong, alertShort, atsTs]
    // --
[__ATS_ALERT, __ATS_ALERT_LONG, __ATS_ALERT_SHORT, __ATS_TS] = calculateATS(close, __ATS_LEN, __ATS_FCT, __ATS_ADAPTIV, __ATS_SMOOTH)
// }


//  ▪ STATIC/TRAILING TAKE PROFIT ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Multi-Level Inputs {
//
series bool __ON_RESET_TRAIL = __SINCE_TRL >= __TR_STC_TP1_RESET_FROM and __TR_STC_TP1_RESET_FROM > 0
__MTP_TP1_LVL := __ON_RESET_TRAIL ? 0 : __MTP_TP1_LVL
// --
var series array<string> TP1 = str.split(__TR_STC_TP1_STRING, '|')
var series array<string> TP1_QTY = str.split(__TR_STC_TP1_QTY_STRING, '|')
var series array<string> TP1_EXT = str.split(__TR_STC_TP1_EXT_STRING, '|')
__TR_STC_TP1 := array.size(TP1) > 0 ? str.tonumber(array.get(TP1, __MTP_TP1_LVL)) : nz(__TR_STC_TP1, 2)
__TR_STC_TP1_QTY := array.size(TP1_QTY) <= 1 or __MTP_TP1_LVL + 1 == array.size(TP1_QTY) ? 100 : int(str.tonumber(array.get(TP1_QTY, __MTP_TP1_LVL)))
series bool __TR_STC_TP1_EXT = array.size(TP1_EXT) > 0 ? int(str.tonumber(array.get(TP1_EXT, __MTP_TP1_LVL))) == 1 ? true : false : true
// --
var series array<string> SL1 = str.split(__TR_STC_SL1_STRING, '|')
var series array<string> SL1_QTY = str.split(__TR_STC_SL1_QTY_STRING, '|')
__TR_STC_SL1 := array.size(SL1) > 0 ? str.tonumber(array.get(SL1, __MTP_SL1_LVL)) : nz(__TR_STC_SL1, 2)
series float __TR_STC_SL1_QTY = array.size(SL1_QTY) <= 1 or __MTP_SL1_LVL + 1 == array.size(SL1_QTY) ? 100 : int(str.tonumber(array.get(SL1_QTY, __MTP_SL1_LVL)))
// --
var series array<string> TRL1 = str.split(__TR_TRL_ST1_STRING, '|')
var series array<string> TRL1_QTY = str.split(__TR_TRL_ST1_QTY_STRING, '|')
__TR_TRL_ST1 := array.size(TRL1) > 0 ? str.tonumber(array.get(TRL1, __MTP_ST1_LVL)) : nz(__TR_TRL_ST1, 2)
series float __TR_TRL_ST1_QTY = array.size(TRL1_QTY) <= 1 or __MTP_ST1_LVL + 1 == array.size(TRL1_QTY) ? 100 : int(str.tonumber(array.get(TRL1_QTY, __MTP_ST1_LVL)))
// }

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ──── Static Trailing Take Minimum-Low Profits {
//
var series bool __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD = false
series bool __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_HIT = false
// --
series float __TR_RLZ_LW1_ADD = __TR_RLZ_LW1_ON and __TR_RLZ_LW1_JST ? __MTP_TP1_LVL == 1 ? str.tonumber(array.get(TP1, 1)) : __MTP_TP1_LVL > 1 ? str.tonumber(array.get(TP1, __MTP_TP1_LVL)) - str.tonumber(array.get(TP1, __MTP_TP1_LVL - 1)) : 0 : 0
series float __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_WR = __TR_RLZ_LW1_START + __TR_RLZ_LW1_ADD
series float __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_WR = __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN + __TR_RLZ_LW1_ADD
// --
series float __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_VALUE = __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 + __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_WR / 100) : __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 - __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_WR / 100)
series float __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_VALUE = __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 + __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_WR / 100) : __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 - __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_WR / 100)
// --
__TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD := __TR_RLZ_LW1_ON and __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD == false and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_FROM ? __ORX_LONG and close > __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_VALUE ? true : __ORX_SHORT and close < __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_VALUE ? true : false : __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD
// --
__TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD := __MTP_TP1_LVL != __MTP_TP1_LVL[1] ? false : __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD
__TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_HIT := __TR_RLZ_LW1_ON and __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_TGD and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_RLZ_LW1_START_FROM ? __ORX_LONG and close < __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_VALUE ? true : __ORX_SHORT and close > __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_VALUE ? true : false : false
if __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_HIT
    __DESC_STRING := 'RL'
    __DESC_STRING
    // }

// ──── Static-Trailing Take Profit {
//
series float __STC_TP1 = na
series bool __STC_TP1_HIT = false
series bool __STC_TP1_TGR = false
// --
if __TR_STC_TP1_ON and orx.isOpen()
    __STC_TP1 := __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 + __TR_STC_TP1 / 100) : __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 - __TR_STC_TP1 / 100)
    __STC_TP1_TGR := __ORX_LONG ? close > __STC_TP1 : __ORX_SHORT ? close < __STC_TP1 : false
    if __STC_TP1_TGR
        __STC_TP1_HIT := (__ORX_LONG or __ORX_SHORT) and __GRID_CTR >= __TR_STC_TP1_START_FROM ? __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == ATS and __TR_STC_TP1_EXT ? (__ORX_LONG and __ATS_ALERT_SHORT or __ORX_SHORT and __ATS_ALERT_LONG) and __STC_TP1_TGR : __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == REACT or __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA or __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA_LONG and __TR_STC_TP1_EXT ? __ALERT and __STC_TP1_TGR : __STC_TP1_TGR : false
        __STC_TP1_HIT
    if __STC_TP1_HIT
        __DESC_STRING := 'TP'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }

// ──── Static-Trailing Stop-Loss {
//
series float __STC_SL1 = na
series bool __STC_SL1_HIT = false
series bool __STC_SL1_TGR = false
// --
if __TR_STC_SL1_ON and orx.isOpen()
    __STC_SL1 := __ORX_LONG ? __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 - __TR_STC_SL1 / 100) : __ORX_AVG_PRICE * (1 + __TR_STC_SL1 / 100)
    __STC_SL1_TGR := __ORX_LONG ? close < __STC_SL1 : __ORX_SHORT ? close > __STC_SL1 : false
    if __STC_SL1_TGR
        __STC_SL1_HIT := (__ORX_LONG or __ORX_SHORT) and __GRID_CTR >= __TR_STC_SL1_START_FROM ? __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == REACT or __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA or __TR_STC_TP1_EXTEND == VIDYA_LONG ? __ALERT and __STC_SL1_TGR : __STC_SL1_TGR : false
        __STC_SL1_HIT
    if __STC_SL1_HIT
        __DESC_STRING := 'SL'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }

// ──── Trailing Stop {
//
var series array<float> TRL_SRC = array.new_float(0, 0.)
series float __TRL_ST1 = na
series bool __TRL_ST1_HIT = false
// --
if __TR_TRL_ST1_ON and orx.isOpen()
    array.push(TRL_SRC, __TR_TRL_ST1_SRC == SR_HL and __ORX_LONG ? high : __TR_TRL_ST1_SRC == SR_HL and __ORX_SHORT ? low : __TR_TRL_ST1_SRC == OHLC4 ? ohlc4 : close)
    if __TR_TRL_ST1_ONLY_PROFIT and (__ORX_LONG and close < __ORX_AVG_PRICE or __ORX_SHORT and close > __ORX_AVG_PRICE)
        array.clear(TRL_SRC)
    __TRL_ST1 := __ORX_LONG and close > __ORX_AVG_PRICE ? array.max(TRL_SRC) * (1 - __TR_TRL_ST1 / 100) : __ORX_SHORT and close < __ORX_AVG_PRICE ? array.min(TRL_SRC) * (1 + __TR_TRL_ST1 / 100) : float(na)
    __TRL_ST1_HIT := (__ORX_LONG or __ORX_SHORT) and __GRID_CTR >= __TR_STC_TP1_START_FROM ? __ORX_LONG and close < __TRL_ST1 ? true : __ORX_SHORT and close > __TRL_ST1 ? true : false : false
    if __TRL_ST1_HIT
        __DESC_STRING := 'ST'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }

// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// {
__TRL_TGR := __TR_STC_TP1_ON and __STC_TP1_TGR or __TR_STC_SL1_ON and __STC_SL1_TGR
__TRL_HIT := __TR_STC_TP1_ON and __STC_TP1_HIT and not __STC_TP1_HIT[1] or __TR_TRL_ST1_ON and __TRL_ST1_HIT and not __TRL_ST1_HIT[1] or __TR_STC_SL1_ON and __STC_SL1_HIT and not __STC_SL1_HIT[1]
// }


//  ▪ CONDITION - ADJUSTMENT  ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// **
// -- LEGEND
// *  (G)   Grid = Need Grid Long or SHort
// *  (I)   Injection = Extra action
// *  (P)   Prevent = Disables Post-Calculation
// *  (FC)  Full Close
// *  (RS)  Resize Contracts
// *  (S)   State Change
// *  (Z)   Position Size Zero


// ── Trend Multiplikator
if __CALC_CF_ON
    __CTX_LONG := __TREND_DOWN ? __CTX_LONG * __CALC_CF_UP : __CTX_LONG * __CALC_CF_DW
    __CTX_SHORT := __TREND_UP ? __CTX_SHORT * __CALC_CF_UP : __CTX_SHORT * __CALC_CF_DW
    __CTX_SHORT


// ── Kelly Ratio (RS) {
//
if __TR_KELLY_R
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * orx.kellyRatio()
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * orx.kellyRatio()
    __CTX_SHORT
    // }

// ── Exit Soft (G)(P)(I) {
//
if __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_SOFT > 0 and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_SOFT and __ORX_SHORT and __GRID_LONG
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __INJECTION := true
    __PREVENT := true
    __CTX_LONG := __QTY_FULL_ABS * .66
    __DESC_STRING := 'EX'
    __DESC_STRING
if __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_SOFT > 0 and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_SOFT and __ORX_LONG and __GRID_SHORT
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __INJECTION := true
    __PREVENT := true
    __CTX_SHORT := __QTY_FULL_ABS * .66
    __DESC_STRING := 'EX'
    __DESC_STRING
    // }

// ── Exit Hard (P)(FC) {
//
if __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_HARD > 0 and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_HARD and __ORX_SHORT and close <= __ORX_AVG_PRICE - __ORX_AVG_PRICE * __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_THS and not __GRID_LONG and __TREND_UP
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __COND_FULL_CLOSE := true
    __CTX_LONG := __QTY_FULL_ABS
    __PREVENT := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'EX!'
    __DESC_STRING
if __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_HARD > 0 and math.max(__GRID_CTR_LONG, __GRID_CTR_SHORT) >= __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_HARD and __ORX_LONG and close >= __ORX_AVG_PRICE + __ORX_AVG_PRICE * __TR_MAX_ORX_EXIT_THS and not __GRID_SHORT and __TREND_DOWN
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __COND_FULL_CLOSE := true
    __CTX_SHORT := __QTY_FULL_ABS
    __PREVENT := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'EX!'
    __DESC_STRING
    // }

// ── Reverse (S)(RS)(I)(P) {
//
if __VDY_LOCK_LONG and __GRID_LONG and __GRID >= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and __VDY_REV_LONG_TO_SHORT and strategy.position_size == 0
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * __VDY_REVERSE_CTX_FCT
    __CTX_LONG := 0
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __INJECTION := true
    __PREVENT := true
    __DESC_STRING := REVERSED
    __DESC_STRING
    // --
if __VDY_LOCK_SHORT and __GRID_SHORT and __GRID <= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and __VDY_REV_SHORT_TO_LONG and strategy.position_size == 0
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * __VDY_REVERSE_CTX_FCT
    __CTX_SHORT := 0
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __PREVENT := true
    __INJECTION := true
    __DESC_STRING := REVERSED
    __DESC_STRING
    // }

// ── Buy-Back / Sell-Back #1 (S)(RS)(I)(P) { *
//
if __VDY_RELOAD_LONG and __TREND_UP and __TREND_RISING and strategy.position_size == 0 and __SINCE_LAST >= 5 and close > __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and close <= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED * (1 + __VDY_RELOAD_ZONE_FCT / 100) and not __GRID_SHORT
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __INJECTION := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'BB'
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * __VDY_RELOAD_CTX_FCT
    __PREVENT := true
    __PREVENT
if __VDY_RELOAD_SHORT and __TREND_DOWN and __TREND_FALLING and strategy.position_size == 0 and __SINCE_LAST >= 5 and close < __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and close >= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED * (1 - __VDY_RELOAD_ZONE_FCT / 100) and not __GRID_LONG
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __INJECTION := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'SB'
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * __VDY_RELOAD_CTX_FCT
    __PREVENT := true
    __PREVENT
    // }

// ── Buy-Back / Sell-Back #2 (S)(RS)(I)(P) { *
//
if __VDY_RELOAD_LONG2 and __TREND_DOWN and __TREND_RISING and strategy.position_size == 0 and __SINCE_LAST >= __TR_BB_SINCE_LAST and f_barssince(ta.crossover(close, __SRC_VIDYA), 0) >= __TR_BB_SINCE_LAST_X and not __GRID_SHORT and not __PREVENT
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __INJECTION := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'BB2'
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * __VDY_RELOAD_CTX_FCT
    __PREVENT := true
    __PREVENT
if __VDY_RELOAD_SHORT2 and __TREND_UP and __TREND_FALLING and strategy.position_size == 0 and __SINCE_LAST >= __TR_BB_SINCE_LAST and f_barssince(ta.crossunder(close, __SRC_VIDYA), 0) >= __TR_BB_SINCE_LAST_X and not __GRID_LONG and not __PREVENT
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __INJECTION := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'SB2'
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * __VDY_RELOAD_CTX_FCT
    __PREVENT := true
    __PREVENT
    // }

// ── Channel (S)(I) {
//
var series bool __CH_UPPER_TRG = false
var series bool __CH_LOWER_TRG = false
__CH_LOWER_TRG := __CH_LOWER_ON ? __CH_NOT_OPEN_LONG and strategy.position_size == 0 or __CH_UPPER_TRG ? false : __CH_LOWER_TRG == false and close < __LOWEST[1] * ((100 + __CH_LOWER_TRL) / 100) and (__SINCE_LAST >= __CH_LOCK or __SINCE_LAST < __CH_LOCK and __CH_UPPER_TRG) and __RSI <= __CH_OB ? true : false : false
__CH_UPPER_TRG := __CH_HIGHER_ON ? __CH_NOT_OPEN_SHORT and strategy.position_size == 0 or __CH_LOWER_TRG ? false : __CH_UPPER_TRG == false and close > __HIGHEST[1] * ((100 - __CH_HIGHER_TRL) / 100) and (__SINCE_LAST >= __CH_LOCK or __SINCE_LAST < __CH_LOCK and __CH_LOWER_TRG) and __RSI >= __CH_OS ? true : false : false
if __CH_UPPER_TRG
    __GRID_SHORT := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'UCH'
    __DESC_STRING
if __CH_LOWER_TRG
    __GRID_LONG := true
    __DESC_STRING := 'LCH'
    __DESC_STRING
    // }


// ── Fibonacci-Retracement Level (RS) {
//
if __VDY_FIBO_ON
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * (1 + __RETRACEMENT)
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * (1 + __RETRACEMENT)
    __CTX_SHORT
    // }

// ──── Martingale Exponent (G)(RS) {
//
if __GRID_LONG or __GRID_SHORT
    __MTG := __MTG_RESET_ON_OPPOSITE and (__ORX_LONG and __GRID_SHORT or __ORX_SHORT and __GRID_LONG) or __MTG_RESET_ON_TRAIL and __TRL_HIT ? __MTG_START : math.max(__GRID_CTR_SHORT, __GRID_CTR_LONG) >= __MTG_START_FROM ? math.max(__GRID_CTR_SHORT, __GRID_CTR_LONG) == __MTG_START_FROM ? __MTG_START * __MTG_STEP : __MTG_MODE == POSITION ? nz(__MTG, __MTG_START) * __MTG_STEP : nz(__MTG, __MTG_START) + nz(__MTG, __MTG_START) * __MTG_STEP : __MTG_BEFORE_START
    __MTG
__MTG := __MTG > __MTG_MAX ? __MTG_MAX : __MTG
// --
if __MTG_ON
    __CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG * __MTG
    __CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT * __MTG
    __CTX_SHORT
    // }


// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  ▪ CONTRACTS - FORCEABLE POST-CALCULATION  ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ── Baseline Locking (L) {
//
if __VDY_LOCK_LONG and __GRID_LONG and close >= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and not __INJECTION and not __TRL_HIT and not __ORX_SHORT
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __CTX_LONG := 0.
    __DESC_STRING := 'PR'
    __LOCKED := true
    __LOCKED
if __VDY_LOCK_SHORT and __GRID_SHORT and close <= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and not __INJECTION and not __TRL_HIT and not __ORX_LONG
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __CTX_SHORT := 0.
    __DESC_STRING := 'PR'
    __LOCKED := true
    __LOCKED
    // --
if __VDY_LOCK_LONG2 and __GRID_LONG and __GRID >= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and not __INJECTION and not __TRL_HIT and not __ORX_SHORT
    __GRID_LONG := false
    __CTX_LONG := 0.
    __DESC_STRING := 'GR'
    __LOCKED := true
    __LOCKED
if __VDY_LOCK_SHORT2 and __GRID_SHORT and __GRID <= __SRC_VIDYA_WEIGHTED and not __INJECTION and not __TRL_HIT and not __ORX_LONG
    __GRID_SHORT := false
    __CTX_SHORT := 0.
    __DESC_STRING := 'GR'
    __LOCKED := true
    __LOCKED
    // }

// ── No Negativ Trades (L) * {
//
if __CALC_NO_NEGATIVE and (not __TRL_HIT and not __PREVENT or (__TRL_HIT or __PREVENT) and __FRC_NO_NEGATIVE)
    if __GRID_LONG and __ORX_LONG and close >= __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __CTX_LONG := 0.
        __GRID_LONG := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'NN'
        __DESC_STRING
    if __GRID_SHORT and __ORX_SHORT and close <= __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __CTX_SHORT := 0.
        __GRID_SHORT := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'NN'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }

// ── No Losing Trades (L) * {
//
if __CALC_NO_LOSING and (not __TRL_HIT and not __PREVENT or (__TRL_HIT or __PREVENT) and __FRC_NO_LOSING)
    if __GRID_LONG and __ORX_SHORT and close >= __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __CTX_LONG := 0.
        __GRID_LONG := false
        __DESC_STRING := 'NL'
        __DESC_STRING
    if __GRID_SHORT and __ORX_LONG and close <= __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __CTX_SHORT := 0
        __GRID_SHORT := false
        __DESC_STRING := 'NL'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }

// ──── Filter {
//
if not __TRL_HIT and not __PREVENT
    // -- Filter #3: Only Best Trades *
    if __CALC_COMPARE and __LAST_ENTRY != 0 and __GRID_LONG and __ORX_LONG and close >= __LAST_ENTRY * (1 - __TR_MIN_DIST / 100)
        __CTX_LONG := 0
        __GRID_LONG := false
        __DESC_STRING := 'OB'
        __DESC_STRING
    if __CALC_COMPARE and __LAST_ENTRY != 0 and __GRID_SHORT and __ORX_SHORT and close <= __LAST_ENTRY * (1 + __TR_MIN_DIST / 100)
        __CTX_SHORT := 0
        __GRID_SHORT := false
        __DESC_STRING := 'OB'
        __DESC_STRING

    // -- Filter #4: Disabled Retracement Level (Z)
    if __GRID_LONG and __VDY_FIBO_LONG_DIS != 0 and __POS >= __VDY_FIBO_LONG_DIS and strategy.position_size == 0 and __POS < 0
        __CTX_LONG := 0.
        __GRID_LONG := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'RT'
        __DESC_STRING
    if __GRID_SHORT and __VDY_FIBO_SHORT_DIS != 0 and __POS <= __VDY_FIBO_SHORT_DIS and strategy.position_size == 0 and __POS > 0
        __CTX_SHORT := 0.
        __GRID_SHORT := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'RT'
        __DESC_STRING

    // -- Filter #5: Not Open Long/Short (Z)
    if strategy.position_size == 0 and __GRID_LONG and __TR_NOT_OPEN_LONG
        __GRID_LONG := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'X'
        __DESC_STRING
    if strategy.position_size == 0 and __GRID_SHORT and __TR_NOT_OPEN_SHORT
        __GRID_SHORT := false
        __LOCKED := true
        __DESC_STRING := 'X'
        __DESC_STRING
        // }


//  ▪  ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ── {
//
series bool __MBB_ERROR = __ORX_OPEN and __SINCE_START > 4990
var series int __ORX_MAX_LENGTH = na
__ORX_MAX_LENGTH := math.max(__ORX_MAX_LENGTH, __SINCE_START)
// --
__GRID_LONG := __GRID_LONG and __CTX_LONG == 0 ? false : __GRID_LONG
__GRID_SHORT := __GRID_SHORT and __CTX_SHORT == 0 ? false : __GRID_SHORT
// --
series float __QTY_TRL = __TR_STC_TP1_QTY * __QTY_FULL_ABS / 100
series float __QTY_RED = __TR_REDUCE_PCT * __QTY_FULL_ABS / 100
// -- Trailing
__CTX_LONG := __TRL_HIT ? __QTY_TRL : __CTX_LONG
__CTX_SHORT := __TRL_HIT ? __QTY_TRL : __CTX_SHORT
// -- Stop-Loss Reduce
__CTX_LONG := __TR_REDUCE_PCT > 0 and __SL_USED_PCT >= __TR_SL_PCT ? __QTY_RED : __CTX_LONG
__CTX_SHORT := __TR_REDUCE_PCT > 0 and __SL_USED_PCT >= __TR_SL_PCT ? __QTY_RED : __CTX_SHORT
// -- 
__CTX_LONG := __COND_FULL_CLOSE ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __CTX_LONG
__CTX_SHORT := __COND_FULL_CLOSE ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __CTX_SHORT
// --
__COND_FULL_CLOSE := __MBB_ERROR ? true : __COND_FULL_CLOSE
__DESC_STRING := __MBB_ERROR ? '>MBB' : __DESC_STRING
// }

// ──── Min. Position Size ex. Closing Orders (RS) {
//
series float __MIN_POS_SIZE = __TR_MIN_POS_SIZE_USDT / close
__CTX_LONG := __CTX_LONG < __MIN_POS_SIZE and __CTX_LONG != 0. and not __ORX_SHORT ? __MIN_POS_SIZE : __CTX_LONG
__CTX_SHORT := __CTX_SHORT < __MIN_POS_SIZE and __CTX_SHORT != 0. and not __ORX_LONG ? __MIN_POS_SIZE : __CTX_SHORT
// }

// ──── Decimal Units {
//
__CTX_LONG := math.round(__CTX_LONG, __TR_POS_DEC)
__CTX_SHORT := math.round(__CTX_SHORT, __TR_POS_DEC)
// }

// ──── Transition {
//
__CTX_LONG := __TR_TRANS == STRICT and math.abs(__CTX_LONG) > __QTY_FULL_ABS and __ORX_OPEN ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __CTX_LONG
__CTX_SHORT := __TR_TRANS == STRICT and math.abs(__CTX_SHORT) > __QTY_FULL_ABS and __ORX_OPEN ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __CTX_SHORT
// }

// {
series float __CTX_LONG_ABS = math.abs(__CTX_LONG)
series float __CTX_SHORT_ABS = math.abs(__CTX_SHORT)
// }


//  ▪ CONDITION  ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░

// ──── Short-Hand Condition {
//
series bool __COND_PART_CLOSE_SL = __TR_REDUCE_PCT > 0 ? __SL_USED_PCT >= __TR_SL_PCT ? true : false : false
series bool __COND_CLOSE = f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TRL_HIT
series bool __COND_STACK_LONG_CLOSE = f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == LONG_STACK
series bool __COND_STACK_SHORT_CLOSE = f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == SHORT_STACK
// --
series bool __COND_STACK_LONG = __GRID_LONG and f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == LONG_STACK and not __LOCKED and not __COND_STACK_LONG_CLOSE
series bool __COND_STACK_SHORT = __GRID_SHORT and f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == SHORT_STACK and not __LOCKED and not __COND_STACK_SHORT_CLOSE
series bool __COND_FULL_STACK_LONG = __GRID_LONG and f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == FULL_STACK and not __LOCKED // and not __COND_FULL_CLOSE
series bool __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT = __GRID_SHORT and f_tf_backtestWindow() and __TR_DIR == FULL_STACK and not __LOCKED // and not __COND_FULL_CLOSE
series bool __COND_ORDER_ALL = __COND_STACK_LONG or __COND_FULL_STACK_LONG or __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_LONG_CLOSE or __COND_STACK_SHORT_CLOSE
// --
// __COND_FULL_CLOSE := __COND_STACK_LONG_CLOSE or __COND_STACK_SHORT_CLOSE ? true : __COND_FULL_CLOSE
__COND_FULL_CLOSE := __TR_TRANS == STRICT and (__COND_FULL_STACK_LONG and __ORX_SHORT and __CTX_LONG >= __QTY_FULL_ABS or __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT and __ORX_LONG and __CTX_SHORT >= __QTY_FULL_ABS) ? true : __COND_FULL_CLOSE
__COND_FULL_CLOSE := __TR_RLZ_LW1_ON and __TR_RLZ_LW1_MIN_HIT and __TR_RLZ_LW1_EXIT or __TR_STC_TP1_ON and __STC_TP1_HIT and __MTP_TP1_LVL == array.size(TP1) - 1 or __TR_TRL_ST1_ON and __TRL_ST1_HIT and __MTP_ST1_LVL == array.size(TRL1) - 1 or __TR_STC_SL1_ON and __STC_SL1_HIT and __MTP_SL1_LVL == array.size(SL1) - 1 ? true : __COND_FULL_CLOSE
bool __ORDER_EXEC = __COND_ORDER_ALL or __COND_FULL_CLOSE or __INJECTION or __TRL_HIT
// --
__LAST_ENTRY := __GRID_LONG and __ORX_LONG or __GRID_SHORT and __ORX_SHORT ? close : __ORX_OPENED ? close[1] : __LAST_ENTRY
// }


//  ▪ POSITION AVERAGE PRICE ────
// ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░


// ──── Position Calculation / Position Average Price {
//
__ORX_AVG_PRICE := f_order_avgPrice(__BACKTEST_ENGINE, __ORX_SUM, __ORX_CTX)
__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT := f_order_openProfit(__ORX_AVG_PRICE)

if strategy.position_size == 0
    __ORX_SUM := 0.
    __ORX_CTX := 0.
    __ORX_PNL := 0.
    __ORX_COM := 0.
    __ORX_COM

if strategy.position_size < 0 or strategy.position_size == 0 and (__COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_SHORT)
    __POS_CTX := __COND_FULL_CLOSE ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __COND_FULL_STACK_LONG or __COND_STACK_LONG ? __CTX_LONG : __CTX_SHORT
    __POS_SUM := __POS_CTX * close
    __POS_COM := __POS_SUM * (CommissionValue / 100)
    if __COND_FULL_STACK_LONG or __COND_STACK_LONG or __COND_FULL_CLOSE or __COND_PART_CLOSE_SL
        __POS_PNL := __POS_CTX * __ORX_AVG_PRICE - __POS_SUM
        __PROFIT := true
        __ORX_PNL := __ORX_PNL + __POS_PNL
        __ORX_CTX := __ORX_CTX - __POS_CTX
        __ORX_SUM := __ORX_SUM - __POS_CTX * __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __ORX_COM := __ORX_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM := __TOTAL_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_PNL := __TOTAL_PNL + __POS_PNL
        __TOTAL_PNL
    // -- EXTEND
    else if __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_SHORT
        __ORX_CTX := __ORX_CTX + __POS_CTX
        __ORX_SUM := __ORX_SUM + __POS_SUM
        __ORX_COM := __ORX_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM := __TOTAL_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM
        // -- IN LONG ORDER
else if strategy.position_size > 0 or strategy.position_size == 0 and (__COND_FULL_STACK_LONG or __COND_STACK_LONG)
    __POS_CTX := __COND_FULL_CLOSE ? __QTY_FULL_ABS : __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_SHORT ? __CTX_SHORT : __CTX_LONG
    __POS_SUM := __POS_CTX * close
    __POS_COM := __POS_SUM * (CommissionValue / 100)
    if __COND_FULL_STACK_SHORT or __COND_STACK_SHORT or __COND_FULL_CLOSE or __COND_PART_CLOSE_SL
        __POS_PNL := __POS_CTX * __ORX_AVG_PRICE - __POS_SUM
        __PROFIT := true
        __ORX_PNL := __ORX_PNL + __POS_PNL
        __ORX_CTX := __ORX_CTX - __POS_CTX
        __ORX_SUM := __ORX_SUM - __POS_CTX * __ORX_AVG_PRICE
        __ORX_COM := __ORX_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM := __TOTAL_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_PNL := __TOTAL_PNL + __POS_PNL
        __TOTAL_PNL
    // -- EXTEND
    else if __COND_FULL_STACK_LONG or __COND_STACK_LONG
        __ORX_CTX := __ORX_CTX + __POS_CTX
        __ORX_SUM := __ORX_SUM + __POS_SUM
        __ORX_COM := __ORX_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM := __TOTAL_COM + __POS_COM
        __TOTAL_COM
        // --
__ORX_AVG_PRICE := f_order_avgPrice(__BACKTEST_ENGINE, __ORX_SUM, __ORX_CTX)
__ORX_OPEN_PROFIT := f_order_openProfit(__ORX_AVG_PRICE)
__NETTO_PNL := __TOTAL_PNL - __TOTAL_COM
float __TOTAL_COM_FROM_PROFIT_PCT = __TOTAL_PNL == 0 ? 0 : __TOTAL_COM / __TOTAL_PNL * 100

// Get futures-corrected statistics (now that all variables are calculated)
[customEquity, customReturn, winRate, customNetPnL, totalCommission, 
 commissionRatio, currentAvgPrice, openProfit, currentPnLPct, maxDrawdownPct, currentMarginUsed] = f_getFuturesStatistics(__TOTAL_PNL, __TOTAL_COM, __ORX_OPEN_PROFIT, __NETTO_PNL, __ORX_AVG_PRICE)

// ✅ IMPROVEMENT: Enhanced table with FUTURES-SPECIFIC metrics (moved here after function call)
if barstate.islast and __PRINT_JOURNAL
    var table futuresTable = table.new(position.top_right, 3, 10, 
         bgcolor=color.new(color.black, 85), border_width=1)
    
    // Header
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 0, "📊 FUTURES GRID", text_color=color.white, 
         text_size=size.normal, bgcolor=color.new(color.blue, 80))
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 0, strategyStatus, text_color=color.white, 
         text_size=size.normal)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 0, gridStatus, text_color=color.white, 
         text_size=size.normal)
    
    // ✅ FUTURES CORRECTED: Custom equity and P&L
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 1, "Equity", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 1, f_formatStatistic(customEquity, " ₮"), text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 2, "Return", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 2, f_formatStatistic(customReturn, "%"), text_color=customNetPnL > 0 ? color.green : color.red, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 3, "Net P&L", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 3, f_formatStatistic(customNetPnL, " ₮"), text_color=customNetPnL > 0 ? color.green : color.red, text_size=size.small)
    
    // ✅ FUTURES CORRECTED: Position information
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 4, "Avg Price", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 4, strategy.position_size != 0 ? f_formatStatistic(currentAvgPrice, " ₮") : "---",  text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 5, "Open P&L", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 5, strategy.position_size != 0 ? f_formatStatistic(currentPnLPct, "%") : "---",  text_color=openProfit > 0 ? color.green : openProfit < 0 ? color.red : color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    // Trade statistics
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 6, "Win Rate", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 6, f_formatStatistic(winRate, "%"),  text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 7, "Commission", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 7, f_formatStatistic(commissionRatio, "%"),  text_color=color.orange, text_size=size.small)
    
    // Risk metrics
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 8, "Max DD", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 8, f_formatStatistic(maxDrawdownPct, "%"),  text_color=color.red, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 0, 9, "Drawdown", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    // Use simplified drawdown calculation
    simplifiedDrawdown = math.abs(strategy.max_drawdown) / strategy.initial_capital * 100
    riskColor = simplifiedDrawdown > 10 ? color.red : simplifiedDrawdown > 5 ? color.orange : color.green
    table.cell(futuresTable, 1, 9, f_formatStatistic(simplifiedDrawdown, "%"),  text_color=riskColor, text_size=size.small)
    
    // Grid information in column 3
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 1, "Open Trades", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 2, str.tostring(strategy.opentrades),  text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 3, "Position Size", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 4, strategy.position_size != 0 ? str.tostring(math.abs(strategy.position_size)) : "---",  text_color=color.white, text_size=size.small)
    
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 5, "Margin Used", text_color=color.gray, text_size=size.small)
    table.cell(futuresTable, 2, 6, f_formatStatistic(currentMarginUsed, "%"),  text_color=currentMarginUsed > 80 ? color.red : currentMarginUsed > 50 ? color.orange : color.green, text_size=size.small)

// ✅ IMPROVEMENT: Enhanced Statistics for Futures Trading
// Function definition moved earlier in script to fix "function call before declaration" error

